<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Muda six-mth net down 74.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Muda six-mth net down 74.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   5.03   vs	  19.61</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  3.2    vs	  12.4</p>
<p>    Turnover		   134.75   vs	 145.56</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     7.50   vs	  19.79</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	   39.09   vs	    -</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	  -     vs	    -</p>
<p>NOTE - Muda Holdings Bhd is engaged in making paper products and general insurance services among other businesses.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
